WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
[Soft original electronic score]

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.958
Culture moves with people. So does rhythm.

00:00:05.808 --> 00:00:13.941
Samba de roda, rooted in Bahia, travelled with migrants and influenced the development of urban samba in Rio de Janeiro.

00:00:14.791 --> 00:00:20.959
That connection is one doorway into a larger story of community, movement, and shared memory.

00:00:21.809 --> 00:00:29.667
These are contemporary abstract images. The synthetic score is not a samba recording or a community performance.

